<div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden">
    <div class="field__items">
          <div class="field__item"><p>Contact police on 000 in an emergency. This includes immediate threats to people or property or if a serious crime is in progress.</p><p>Contact police on 131 444 or in person at your local police station to report crimes that have happened in the past, request police attendance or for general information not covered on the website.</p><p><a class="box-link" href="/service/security/law-enforcement/submit-police-commendation" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="605fa126-72c5-4744-9f00-c03ed3260466" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Submit a police commendation">Commendation form</a></p><p><a class="box-link" href="/service/security/law-enforcement/submit-general-feedback-or-enquiry-wa-police-force" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="1978a36d-4fe9-4b90-8af0-0a07fca2c84a" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Submit general feedback or enquiry to WA Police Force">General enquiry form</a></p><p><a class="box-link" href="/service/security/law-enforcement/submit-police-privacy-complaint" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="cc2cc17d-0c47-4dc5-9048-48086a1bd54d" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Submit a police privacy complaint">Privacy complaint form</a></p><p><a class="box-link" href="/service/security/law-enforcement/report-wa-police-force-employee-misconduct" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="073e63b3-cb5a-46f6-a3a8-49d30b07e493" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Report WA Police Force employee misconduct">WA Police Force employee misconduct form</a></p></div>
